WEBVTT

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.450
Starting today, you're his student.

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:17.620
His?

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:21.000
You only have one thing to worry about.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.200
Surpass the one who teaches you.

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:15.990
"An Unexpected Assassin"

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:25.200
That's the Tower of Fangs.
That's where the city of Tafrem is.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:28.160
That's where I'll be able to become a Sorcerer!

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.700
The school's right behind there.

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:42.660
Apparently, you've noticed me.
I'm too well known.

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:49.660
No one can stop me.

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:53.870
After all, they're the one
who gave me this order.

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:59.410
As long as I have their order,
I will never stop.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:09.370
Another elder was killed?

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:12.580
I think this makes the fifth one.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:16.160
At this rate, all of the
upper echelon will be wiped out.

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:21.870
Who do you think runs this tower?
Hurry up and find the culprit!

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:26.370
Do you realize this is the biggest threat
we've faced since the Tower's creation?

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:31.040
Someone must be trying to start a rebellion.
Take care of this at once.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:33.830
Use force if you need to.

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:42.750
That squad is what started all of this.

00:03:58.830 --> 00:03:59.950
O Flames!

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:01.700
O Wind!

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.330
Hark, O Light!

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:20.000
O Chaos!

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:39.660
Someone's here.

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:42.540
Oh, it's you, Leticia.

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:45.790
Forte, is this report true?

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:48.450
Azalie was defeated?

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:52.290
There's something more
important than the Azalie matter.

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:57.080
Another elder was killed,
and the culprit fell into our network.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:59.250
Another elder?

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:03.910
They must be a very skilled assassin
to be able to kill the elders.

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:07.450
Apparently, the suspect is
on the skinny side and not very tall.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:10.410
They were dressed in
all black and had black hair.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:13.120
They must be a Sorcerer from the tower.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:17.500
And we've received word from Heartia
who's been investigating in Totokanta.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:19.580
Did he find anything out?

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:23.120
Our master met with Krylancelo in the end.

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:24.910
What?

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:28.000
And that's the last anyone saw our master.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:30.870
It's like he was erased from this world.

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:33.540
Don't tell me Krylancelo...

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:37.790
The killings of the elders
might be his form of revenge.

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:43.410
If that's the case, we can't
let any other authority have him...

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:46.750
So that I can carry on the Childman Class.

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:49.080
Forte, you--

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:54.660
We can't go back to how things used to be.

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:06.790
Master!

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:09.000
Found you.

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:17.950
So what did you say
about the food I made, Majic?

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:21.250
I, uh, er...

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:26.660
That I'd be better off with cat food... Maybe?

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:28.330
Die!

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:36.370
Again? Looks like she got you good.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:43.910
So basically, he pointed out how bad her cooking is,

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:48.000
and then she blew up part of the forest?

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.620
R-Right...

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:54.200
Under normal circumstances,
I'd have to hand you over to the Church.

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:56.910
But you're...

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:58.870
I'm a Sorcerer.

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:02.160
If I handed over a Sorcerer to the Church,

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.950
you'd be lucky if they just beat you to death.

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:05.330
You're probably right.

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:09.120
But this incident won't get reported.

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:14.080
I haven't seen anything,
and I haven't heard anything.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.790
Make sure you don't cause any more trouble.

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:20.290
Hurry back to the Tower of Fangs.

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:24.410
It's gone...

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:32.290
Hey!

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:33.660
Hey, what's wrong?

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:39.750
He's dead? For someone to be
able to do this without me realizing...

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:43.410
They must be an assassin
and a skilled one at that.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:52.570
"Who is the successor?"

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:51.330
Who is the successor?

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:58.040
Who is the successor?

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:02.750
I wonder what's wrong with Orphen.

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:07.370
It's strange. It's like he's hiding something.

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:12.330
Look out!

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:16.410
Orphen!

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:19.200
We have to save him!

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:21.330
Wait! It's too dangerous!

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:23.870
Yes, it is dangerous.

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:26.750
He's up there!

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:30.580
I unsheathe thee, Sword of Light!

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:35.250
I did it!

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:40.080
I unsheathe thee, Sword of Light!

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:45.660
You better thank Leki later.

00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:54.580
I see. So it's true that a human
took a Deep Dragon out of the forest.

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:56.370
By the way...

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.250
Orphen!

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:02.950
Master! You're okay!

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:05.290
Yeah, though, I thought I was a goner.

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:09.200
So this kid used that kind of Sorcery?

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:12.370
I thought you really did die for a moment.

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:15.330
Don't mock me, you shitty little brat.

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:18.790
I am a shitty little brat.

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:21.250
I dance within thee,

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:23.120
Heavenly Castle!

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:24.950
He teleported?

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:29.830
I don't blame you for being surprised,
but that's going to leave you wide open!

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:32.620
I strike thee, Glass Hail!

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:40.870
Orphen! Majic!

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:42.790
We're fine. Just a few scratches.

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:45.410
I'm sure I attacked all of you, but apparently,

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:48.830
Sorcery doesn't work on the Dragon.

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:54.040
Claiomh, make sure
he doesn't let down his guard.

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:56.160
What's going on?

00:09:56.160 --> 00:10:00.830
Out of everyone here, the most
powerful one is that black furball,

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:02.620
and the second is that guy.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.410
What are you talking about, Orphen?

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:08.790
I meant what I said. That brat's
Sorcery is a few levels above my own.

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:11.620
You're just too weak.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:13.950
Sorcery that allows you to teleport...

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:18.370
That was something Childman came up
with and requires special formation.

00:10:18.370 --> 00:10:20.580
Why are you able to use it?

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:23.200
It's the most powerful move
from the Tower of Fangs.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:28.040
But I'm able to use it far better than you.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:30.870
Are you truly the successor?

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:32.410
What?!

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:37.830
So you were the one behind that?

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:39.500
I was.

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:44.790
Returning you to normal is what they desire.

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.330
They?

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.750
I have no idea what
the hell you're talking about!

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:58.120
How surprising.
I didn't think we'd be this apart in skill.

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:03.950
Leki! I don't care what you do,
just do something!

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:12.290
You fools... It never crossed
your mind that I was waiting for this?

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:16.830
That may be a Dragon,
but it can't do two things at once.

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:20.410
In this case, I'm referring
to attacking and being on guard.

00:11:21.620 --> 00:11:27.000
Yes. Meaning attacking and
being on guard can't be done at once.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:28.950
I unsheathe thee...

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:30.660
Don't!

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:32.450
...Sword of Light!

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:38.250
He missed?

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:40.040
But how?

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:52.160
I probably can't take on
two members of the Childman Class.

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:56.750
Begone. I will take Krylancelo.

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:02.500
Don't come after me.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.120
His face...

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:11.290
That's...

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:19.950
Why is there two of you?

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:30.250
I don't think we've been
properly introduced yet.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:34.250
That's Claiomh.
She's the daughter a rich guy in Totokanta

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:37.790
and this is Majic, who's my student.

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:41.870
The furball Claiomh
is holding is her pet beast...

00:12:41.870 --> 00:12:43.000
His name's Leki.

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:48.370
And this is Tish. She's a senior
of mine from the Tower of Fangs.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:56.120
But you sure changed a lot in five years.

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:58.330
Are you really Krylancelo?

00:12:58.330 --> 00:12:59.870
The name's Orphen.

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:02.290
So this is where you grew up, Orphen?

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:05.950
Yeah. If they cared about the
fifth biggest city on the continent,

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:08.450
Tafrem would've made the listing.

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:10.450
Halt!

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:17.660
I'm Leticia MacCredy, a high-ranking
Sorcerer from the Tower of Fangs.

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:21.830
I was investigating the current incident,
and the rest of them are with me.

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:24.000
Yes, ma'am! Please go through!

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:31.910
Well, that was pretty extra.

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:35.160
There's been a lot of assassinations lately.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:36.500
Assassinations?

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:37.330
Yes.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.660
You mean, people are getting killed?

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:44.660
Yes, Sorcerers... Elders
at the Tower of Fangs at that.

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:48.950
Elders?

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:52.000
They pretty much run things at the tower.

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:53.790
Sadly, they're not just
a gathering of old people.

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:57.830
But people from the tower
are being killed in Tafrem?

00:13:57.830 --> 00:13:59.830
Why bother going to the city?

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:04.870
Most of them with government jobs lived in Tafrem.

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:08.120
Having a home in the city
was a part of their status.

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:11.160
Our master had one there as well.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:12.910
See?

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.580
Childman...

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:23.160
There hasn't been any more information?

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:25.870
Three last week, and two this week.

00:14:25.870 --> 00:14:29.580
At this rate, the remaining 15 are doomed as well.

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:34.290
You don't think... This is the work
of the Kimluck Church, do you?

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:42.370
Forte told me who was
behind this with his network.

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:45.330
They got caught in the Childman Network?

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:49.410
Yes. The information network
that records every event

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:51.200
that happens on this continent in real time.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:54.580
Though Forte's network
isn't as vast as Master's.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:57.250
But he's able to keep an eye on
things that happen around the tower.

00:14:57.250 --> 00:15:00.120
And the guy from yesterday
got caught in that network?

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:04.580
Yes. The suspect that appeared
from nowhere and killed the elders...

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:08.290
Forte was sure it was you, Krylancelo.

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:16.540
Heartia, just as you reported, he came back.

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:19.950
The Successor of the Razor's Edge.

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:22.370
Do you know what happened to Master afterwards?

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:24.040
No idea.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:28.750
But considering that situation,
I'm pretty sure he was killed.

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:34.500
But the only ones capable of killing Master

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:36.950
are basically just Krylancelo or Azalie.

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:41.080
But Azalie was defeated by Master.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:47.120
And then, Master didn't show
back up in Tafrem, but Krylancelo did.

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:55.750
You always did want your own house, Tish.

00:15:55.750 --> 00:16:02.700
Correct, though it's not a house
I always wanted. It was a family.

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:06.870
Um... This may be rude of me to ask,

00:16:06.870 --> 00:16:10.080
but you don't have a family, Leticia?

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:12.790
Blood relatives, no.

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:17.250
But most Sorcerers at the tower share that fate.

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:18.580
Fate?

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:22.370
Most of the Sorcerers in
the Tower of Fangs are orphans.

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:24.950
I don't have family either, remember?

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:27.750
Well, you're not the
best example of various things...

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:29.000
What's that supposed to mean?

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.830
Oh, nothing...

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:33.450
Anyway, the training
we get at the tower is unique,

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:36.040
so the death rate for students is rather high.

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:40.790
Proper parents would never send
their children to a place like that.

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:43.000
Hey, a kitty.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:46.540
That's Nora. That used to be my cat.

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:47.700
Norman?

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:48.870
It's Nora!

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:51.660
It's been a while, Nora.

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:56.120
They forgot me...

00:16:56.120 --> 00:17:01.580
Most of these rooms belong to my pupils,
but you can use this room.

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:07.330
I see that you still
collect the weirdest things.

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:09.410
What does it matter to you?

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:15.750
Ha, you're missing a tooth, Orphen.

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:17.950
That's when I was seven.

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:21.700
Huh... Is that when you start losing teeth?

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:26.160
Who knows? I'm pretty sure
I lost that tooth in combat training.

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:28.080
Combat?

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:32.040
I say combat training,
but I'm talking about the very basics.

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:36.450
They tied up my hands and
beat me with a stick over and over.

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:42.080
That's what you call the basics?

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:44.250
It's to make you mentally stronger.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:48.910
Black Sorcerers train from that young?

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:53.830
The Tower of Fangs was a rather special place...

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:59.290
But why does Tish's album have
so many pictures of you, Orphen?

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:04.500
Well, she's basically family to me.

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:09.620
The three of us were together ever
since we were at this orphanage.

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:10.950
The three of you?

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:12.580
Tish and Azalie.

00:18:12.580 --> 00:18:17.040
They took care of me at the orphanage.

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:21.200
And yet, somehow all three
of us were taken to the tower

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:24.080
and ended up in the same class.

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:26.580
Aw, you were so cute, Orphen!

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:29.250
To think even you had times like this, Master...

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:31.950
Seriously, what do you guys think I am?

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:35.660
I thought you were how you
are now even when you were little.

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:37.830
Seriously...

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:45.040
Heading out at this hour?

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:48.500
I need to tell Forte that you're not the suspect.

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:52.540
Otherwise I wouldn't want
to go to the tower right now.

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:54.450
Then why don't you just wait until tomorrow?

00:18:54.450 --> 00:19:00.790
You finally came back.
I don't want the tower meddling with you.

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:02.870
You're going to stay, right?

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:11.000
I... can't come back anymore.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:14.410
Ugh, what is with you and Forte?

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:17.080
Why do men have to be like this?

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:33.620
I have to tell Tish everything.

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:37.540
About both Azalie and Childman.

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:39.910
Because he didn't want me to.

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:42.370
You're lying. He was...

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:44.870
Childman was trying to kill me!

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:49.250
You're wrong. Why do you think
he personally went after you?

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:53.120
So that he could return to normal.

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:57.790
Why did he allow you to switch bodies
with him without resisting?

00:19:57.790 --> 00:20:00.410
He should've been able to stop you.

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:02.910
He wanted to save you...

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:05.290
...with his own hands.

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:09.870
No... That can't be true.

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:17.750
I wanted to be a woman worthy of him.

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:22.080
I wonder if Tish will cry...

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:25.540
No, she'll probably be consumed with rage.

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:39.330
To think that the mental control I learned
from Childman would come up here.

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:44.540
I guess that's expected from
highest elites of the Tower of Fangs.

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:48.160
Even I could have a house like this if I wanted.

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:53.000
But there'd be some conditions.

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:56.750
First, you'd have to go
back to the Tower of Fangs,

00:20:56.750 --> 00:20:59.700
with your former powers.

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:01.910
The elders aren't stupid,

00:21:01.910 --> 00:21:04.500
so when they find out you
don't have the powers you used to,

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:06.790
they'll immediately realize how useless you are.

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:12.500
Even if you did have your former powers,

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:16.950
the fact that you left the tower
five years ago won't disappear.

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:18.910
That'd be considered a blemish on your record

00:21:18.910 --> 00:21:24.790
and who knows how many years it'd take
for them to acknowledge your return.

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:26.200
Who are you?

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:27.830
Who am I?

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:31.200
I'm the assassin of this town.

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:34.200
Are you trying to say
that Krylancelo is an assassin?

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:36.290
Pretty much.

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:38.450
What else would you call it?

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:40.790
I'm not here to play word games with you.

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:42.620
That goes for me, as well.

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:54.330
Are you trying to imply
that you're the ghost from my past?

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:57.450
Yes. I am Krylancelo.

00:21:57.450 --> 00:22:01.450
You can just keep calling yourself Orphen.

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:41.870
What were you like as a student
at the Tower of Fangs, Master?

00:23:41.870 --> 00:23:44.580
If you're able to withstand
my Sorcery a hundred times, I'll tell you.

00:23:44.580 --> 00:23:47.000
You're so mean, Master.

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:47.030
"Ghost from the Past"
